   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Suggesting an activity",
     "texto": [
      "**Hai să** plus the **noi** form encourages doing something as a group: **Hai să alegem** («Let's choose»). The verb changes; **hai** stays the same."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Outdoor plans",
     "texto": [
      "**La munte** means «to the mountain» and **împreună**, «together». **Traseu** is a route or path."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
